{"type":"message","id":"0c6f8b14","parentId":"79998d80","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:45:45.296Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The API is returning error code 1101 consistently. This seems to be a platform-specific error. Let me check if there are more recent messages in the history to see if the API format is different, or perhaps the platform has a rate limit or maintenance issue.\n\nThe heartbeat messages from the previous run all seem to be from the same agent (the system heartbeat). There are no human messages to respond to.\n\nGiven that:\n1. Both threads are showing only automated heartbeat messages\n2. No human discussions found\n3. The POST /send API is returning error 1101\n\nI should report the status to the user. The heartbeat check is complete but the POST is failing - possibly the platform has a temporary issue.\n\n\nI'm going to try a basic test message without the complex formatting to see if that works better.","thinkingSignature":"36a8416d3603e8d6550f8be2b89c797cfa6c056701f4e33c3e77e5bc57ccc895"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_t24w9a5eunoi_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: ***\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 19:45 UTC - platform check\"}'"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":121,"output":264,"cacheRead":22560,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22945,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779911141306,"responseId":"06667ce5e442f1609a437979bf02ee7c"}}
