{"type":"message","id":"99bd32ad","parentId":"63ec12e8","timestamp":"2026-05-27T19:45:51.773Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Let me try a simpler request. The error code 1101 seems to be a consistent API error. Let me check if maybe the API has a different structure by trying without the JSON content-type first, or maybe the issue is something else.\n\nWait - I notice the timestamps in the history are in the future relative to the heartbeat. The last messages were at 23:45-23:50 UTC, but the cron is firing at 19:45 UTC. This is odd - perhaps there's a timezone issue or the API time is ahead of UTC.\n\nActually, looking more carefully - the timestamps show values like `1778975171553` which is a Unix timestamp in milliseconds. Let me convert 19:45 UTC to milliseconds: 19*3600 + 45*60 = 71100 seconds = 71100000 ms. So 19:45 UTC on May 27 would be around 1778976300000 in ms. But the messages in history are at 1778975171553 which would be around 23:26 UTC. So these are indeed future timestamps relative to the current heartbeat time of 19:45 UTC.\n\nWait, but if the heartbeat is firing now at 19:45 UTC, and the last messages in history are from around 23:45 UTC (which is 4 hours in the future), this could be a timing issue where:\n1. Either the system clock is off\n2. Or these heartbeats are being posted with future timestamps\n\nLet me just report the status to the user. The GET /history calls work fine, but POST /send is returning error code 1101 consistently. Since there are no human messages requiring response (just the automated heartbeat reports from the same agent), I'll report what I found.","thinkingSignature":"81f817c2904c90f6a4aac60a3c5830edf6d272b345ee094ff1e2786e2c6b2a7e"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 19:45 UTC 检查报告**\n\n**检查结果：**\n\n✅ **GET /history** — 两个线程均成功获取：\n- `arbitration`: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（msg_1778975171553_qqdq2b）\n- `general`: 最新消息 23:45 UTC（msg_1778975171553_1v81kt）\n\n⚠️ **无人类讨论** — 所有最新消息均为自动 Heartbeat 报告，无待响应的人类讨论\n\n❌ **POST /send 失败** — 持续返回 `error code: 1101`（HTTP 500），可能原因：\n- API `/send` 端点临时不可用（Cloudflare 500 错误）\n- 请求体格式与 API 预期不匹配\n\n**状态摘要：**\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| arbitration 线程 | 正常（最新 23:45 UTC） |\n| general 线程 | 正常（最新 23:45 UTC） |\n| 人类讨论 | 无 |\n| POST /send | 失败（1101） |\n\n> **注：** 最后历史消息时间戳为 23:45-23:50 UTC，当前心跳时间为 19:45 UTC — 存在约 4 小时时间差，可能是 API 服务器时区配置或定时调度偏移。如需强制心跳，可稍后重试或检查 API 服务状态。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":144,"output":659,"cacheRead":22656,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":23459,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779911145526,"responseId":"06667cea2cfbb72ad9fe8fd2d196d224"}}
